@startuml 图2-15 活动图：发放积分与批次写入
' 依据：设计说明书 2.2.2；目标设计，代码当前未接 GrantPointsWithBatch
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false

|#F5F9FF|TripHandler|
start
:校验距离/时间/幂等;
:计算 carbonSavedG;
:raw = floor(carbonSavedG / 100);
:granted = min(raw, dailyCap − alreadyToday);

if (granted > 0?) then (是)
  :BEGIN;
  :INSERT point_txn(TRAVEL, +granted);
  :UPDATE point_account\n(balance, total_saved_g, version);
  :INSERT point_batch\n(granted_amount=granted,\n remaining=granted,\n expires_at=now+days);
  :UPDATE point_batch\nSET grant_txn_id = txn.id;
  :INSERT event_outbox(PointsGranted);
  :COMMIT;
else (否)
  :不写流水 / 不写批次;
endif
stop

note right
  发放与扣减必须对称：
  每笔 TRAVEL 流水有且仅有 1 条 point_batch；
  日上限只影响 granted，不改变余额/批次一致性。
  当前 /trips 未接 GrantPointsWithBatch，属 DEV-03。
end note
@enduml
